{"id":"n51130-1-7","stage":5,"title":"들이대다 · 紧贴","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51130-1-7-1","ko":"내 말 알아들었어?","zh":"你听懂我说的话了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아들었어?","meaning":"听懂","explanation":"알아듣다：听懂；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알아듣다","audio":"/audio/dd1a5d23abf4863ecde0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66569","senseId":"1","lemma":"알아듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"dd1a5d23abf4863e","term":"알아듣다","zh":"听懂","audio":"/audio/dd1a5d23abf4863ecde0.mp3","entryId":"66569","definition":"听他人的话并理解其意思。","pronunciation":["아라듣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5b12a1b53c5b4bc599d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n51130-1-7-2","ko":"얼굴 좀 들이대지 말고 이야기해요. 다 들리니까.","zh":"别把脸凑那么近，这样说话吧。我什么都听见了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얼굴","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들이대지","meaning":"紧贴，紧靠","explanation":"들이대다：紧贴，紧靠；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"들이대다","audio":"/audio/973d26a8ab72b4f311cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51130","senseId":"1","lemma":"들이대다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이야기해요.","meaning":"聊天，谈话","explanation":"이야기하다：聊天，谈话；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"이야기하다","audio":"/audio/2c7d5a32132e2df1ca20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17179","senseId":"3","lemma":"이야기하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들리니까.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"973d26a8ab72b4f3","term":"들이대다","zh":"紧贴，紧靠","audio":"/audio/973d26a8ab72b4f311cf.mp3","entryId":"51130","definition":"把物体拿到非常近的地方。","pronunciation":["드리대다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"2c7d5a32132e2df1","term":"이야기하다","zh":"聊天，谈话","audio":"/audio/2c7d5a32132e2df1ca20.mp3","entryId":"17179","definition":"和他人交谈。","pronunciation":["이야기하다"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"f5d8f68f409d3cd7","term":"들리다","zh":"听到，传来","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3","entryId":"70783","definition":"通过耳朵接受声音。","pronunciation":["들리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/32cb36d6c731450dd648.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.44,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=51130","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":164,"sequenceScore":3.2667,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别把脸凑那么近，这样说话吧。我什么都听见了。","你听懂我说的话了吗？","你脸怎么这么红，发生什么事了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你听懂我说的话了吗？","你脸怎么这么红，发生什么事了？","别把脸凑那么近，这样说话吧。我什么都听见了。"],"answer":2}]}
